  "description": "Partial demolition of the extension at ground floor level at the rear of the Waverton Street building and replacement of the single storey extension with a glass roof; partial demolition of the second and third levels of the Waverton Street building and replacement with new second, third and fourth levels; removal of part of the roof of the main building onto Hill Street and installation of new plant with associated screening and a terrace; internal alterations and reconfiguration at all floor levels to include the installation of a new lift shaft; and alterations to the basement to include lowering floor levels and partial excavation of a new basement level to accommodate plant equipment. Installation of plant within the lightwell vaults and within a screened enclosure at rear ground floor level. (Linked with 25/06553/FULL)",
